Scope. This licence covers the analysis tools (tools/), the label databases (labels/), the
hand-written and generated documentation (docs/, README.md, CONTEXT.md, CLAUDE.md) and the build
scripts. It does not cover:

  * the Phoenix Technologies system BIOS, the PhoenixMISER module and the Chips & Technologies
    VGA BIOS analysed here. Their code remains the property of their respective owners and is
    not distributed with this repository; the listings and re-assemblable sources are generated
    locally from a ROM dump the user supplies for their own machine;
  * the XTIDE Universal BIOS source in patched/xtide/src, which is licensed under the GNU GPL
    version 2 (see patched/xtide/src/license.txt and patched/xtide/CHANGES.txt). A ROM image
    built with it embedded is subject to the GPL for that part.
